hadiths[51]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1348","[AI-translation] Imraan bin Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Bani Tameem mein se giroh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Bani Tameem! Khushkhabri paao. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne hamein khushkhabri di to hamein do. To Aapka chehra badal gaya. To Aap key paas Yaman waley aey. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Yaman walon! Khushkhabri qabool karo jab Bani Tameem ne use qabool nahi kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne qabool ki. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) makhlooq ki ibtida aur Arsh ki hadees bayan karney lagey. To aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Imraan! Tumhaari oontni chhoot gai. Kaash main na utha hota! (Bukhari: 3190)"
"1349","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Imraan Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah tha aur uskey siwa koi cheez na thi. Aur uska Arsh paani par tha. Aur us ne Zikr mein har cheez likh di. Aur aasmaan aur zameen paida kiye. To pukaarne waley ne pukaara: Ae Ibn Husain tumhaari oontni gai. To main gaya aur wo thi ke us se aagey reet chamak rahi thi. To Allah ki qasam kaash main use chhorey rakhta! (Bukhari: 3191)"
"1350","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Aadam ka beta mujhey gaali deta hai jabke usey mujhey gaali dena munaasib nahi hai. Aur mujhey jhutlaata hai jabke usey (jhutlaana munaasib nahi). Lekin uski gaali to uska qaul hai ke mera beta hai. Aur uska jhutlaana to uska qaul hai ke wo mujhey waisa wapas na laaeyga jaisa us ne mujhey shuru kya tha. (Bukhari: 3193)"
"1351","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne makhlooq ka faisla kya to apni kitaab mein likha jo uskey paas Arsh key upar hai: Beshak meri rehmat merey ghussay par ghaalib hai. (Bukhari: 3194)"
"1352","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Zamaana ghoom gaya hai jaisa wo us din tha jis din Allah ne aasmaan aur zameen paida kiye they. Saal baarah mahiney hai. Un mein chaar hurmat waley hain. Teen lagataar: Zul Qaada aur Zul Hijja aur Muharram. Aur Mudar ka Rajab jo Jumaada aur Shaban key darmiyaan hai. (Bukhari: 3197)"
"1353","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Zarr se farmaya jab sooraj ghurub hua: Kya tum jaantey ho ke wo kahaan jaata hai? Main ne kaha: Allah aur uska Rasool zyada jaantey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo jaata hai yahan tak ke Arsh key neechey sajda karta hai. To ijazat maangta hai aur use ijazat di jaati hai. Aur qareeb hai ke wo sajda karey aur us se qabool na kya jaey. Aur ijazat maangey aur use ijazat na di jaey. Us se kaha jaaeyga: Jahaan se aey ho wahaan wapas jao. To wo apne maghrib se niklega. To wo Allah Taala ka qaul hai: (Aur sooraj apne thikaaney key liye chalta hai. Ye Zabardast Jaan-ney waley ka andaza hai). (Bukhari: 3199)"
"1354","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Sooraj aur chaand Qiyaamat key din lapetey jaaengey. (Bukhari: 3200)"
"1355","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab aasmaan mein baadal dekhtey to aagey aatey aur peechey jaatey aur daakhil hotey aur nikaltey aur Aapka chehra badal jaata. Phir jab aasmaan barasta to Aap se (wo kefiyat) door hoti. To Aap ko uska bataya gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main nahi jaanta, shayed wo jaisa qaum ne kaha: (Phir jab unhon-ne use baadal dekha jo unki waadiyon ki taraf aata tha) aayat. (Bukhari: 3206)"
"1356","[AI-translation] Yala (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par padhtey huey suna: (Aur wo pukaarengey ae Maalik). (Bukhari: 3230)"
"1357","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne us raat jo mujhey seyr karaai gai Musa ko dekha: Gendum rang lamba ghungryaaley baalon wala aadmi, goya Shanooa key aadmiyon mein se hai. Aur main ne Isa ko dekha: Darmiyaana qad, darmiyaani khilqat surkhi aur safedi ki taraf, seedhey sar waley aadmi. Aur main ne Maalik ko dekha jo aag ka daarogha hai aur Dajjaal ko. Un nishaaniyon mein jo Allah ne use dikhaaein thein: (To uskey milney mein shak mein na ho). (Bukhari: 3239)"
"1358","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya jabke Aap Sacha Tasdeeq kiye gaey hain, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se kisi ki paidaish uski maan key pet mein chaalees din jama ki jaati hai. Phir utni muddat jama hua khoon hota hai. Phir utni muddat boti hota hai. Phir Allah farishta bhejta hai aur use chaar kalimat ka hukm diya jaata hai. Aur us se kaha jaata hai: Uska amal aur uska rizq aur uski muddat likho. Aur badnaseeb ya khushnaseeb. Phir us mein rooh phoonki jaati hai. Phir beshak tum mein se aadmi amal karta hai yahan tak ke uskey aur Jannat key darmiyaan haath bhar key siwa na ho. To us par uski kitaab ghaalib aa jaati hai aur wo aag walon key amal karta hai. Aur amal karta hai yahan tak ke uskey aur aag key darmiyaan haath bhar key siwa na ho. To us par kitaab ghaalib aa jaati hai aur wo Jannat walon key amal karta hai. (Bukhari: 3208)"
"1359","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab Allah bandey se mohabbat rakhta hai to Jibreel ko pukaarta hai: Beshak Allah fulaan se mohabbat rakhta hai, to tum us se mohabbat rakkho. To Jibreel us se mohabbat rakhta hai. To Jibreel aasmaan walon mein pukaarta hai: Beshak Allah fulaan se mohabbat rakhta hai, to tum us se mohabbat rakkho. To aasmaan waley us se mohabbat rakhtey hain. Phir uskey liye zameen mein maqbooliyat rakkhi jaati hai. (Bukhari: 3209)"
"1360","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak farishtey baadal mein utartey hain, aur wo baadal hai, aur us muamley ka zikr kartey hain jiska aasmaan mein faisla kya gaya. To shaitaan kaan laga kar suntey hain aur use suntey hain. To use kaahinon ki taraf wahi kartey hain. To wo uskey sath apne paas se sau jhoot boltey hain. (Bukhari: 3210)"
"1361","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Jumuah ka din ho to masjid key darwaazon mein se har darwaazey par farishtey hotey hain jo pehley phir pehley ko likhtey hain. Phir jab Imam baithey to saheefey lapet detey hain aur zikr sun-ney aatey hain. (Bukhari: 3211)"
"1362","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hassaan se farmaya: Unki hajw karo ya unhey bura kaho, jabke Jibreel tumharey sath hai. (Bukhari: 3213)"
"1363","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Ae Aisha! Ye Jibreel tum par salaam kehtey hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Aur un par salaam aur Allah ki rehmat aur uski barkatein. Tum dekhtey ho jo main nahi dekhti. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka iraada karti thein. (Bukhari: 3217)"
"1364","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jibreel se farmaya: Tum hamaari ziyaarat zyada kyun nahi kartey jitni tum hamaari ziyaarat kartey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: To naazil hui: (Aur ham naazil nahi hotey magar tumharey Rab key hukm se. Uskey liye jo hamaarey saamney hai aur jo hamaarey peechey hai) aayat. (Bukhari: 3218)"
"1365","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujhey harf par padhaaya. To main us se zyada ka mutaaliba karta raha yahan tak ke saat ahruf tak pahuncha. (Bukhari: 3219)"
"1366","[AI-translation] Yala (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par padhtey huey suna: (Aur wo pukaarengey ae Maalik). (Bukhari: 3230)"
"1367","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se Allah Taala key qaul (To wo do kamaanon ya us se qareeb tha. To us ne apne bandey ki taraf wahi ki jo wahi ki) key baarey mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel ko dekha jinkey chhe sau par they. (Bukhari: 3232)"
"1368","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Masood Raziallahu anhu se) Allah Taala key qaul (Beshak us ne apne Rab ki badi nishaaniyon mein se dekhi) key baarey mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Sabz bistar dekha jis ne aasmaan key kinaarey ko dhaanp diya tha. (Bukhari: 3233)"
"1369","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jo gumaan karey ke Muhammad ne apne Rab ko dekha to us ne bada kaha. Lekin us ne Jibreel ko uski soorat mein dekha jabke uski khilqat kinaarey key darmiyaan dhaanpti thi. (Bukhari: 3234)"
"1370","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apne bistar par bulaaey aur wo inkaar karey aur wo us par ghussa hota hua raat guzaarey to farishtey us par subah tak laanat kartey hain. (Bukhari: 323)"
"1371","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi marta hai to us par uska thikaana subah aur shaam pesh kya jaata hai. Phir agar wo Jannat walon mein se hai to Jannat walon mein se. Aur agar wo aag walon mein se hai to aag walon mein se. (Bukhari: 3240)"
"1372","[AI-translation] Imraan bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne Jannat mein jhaanka aur uskey rehne walon mein aksar faqeeron ko dekha. Aur aag mein jhaanka aur uskey rehne walon mein aksar auraton ko dekha. (Bukhari: 3241)"
"1373","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas they ke Aap ne farmaya: Jabke main soya hua tha ke main ne apne aap ko Jannat mein dekha. Phir mahal key pehlu mein aurat wuzu karti hui thi. To main ne kaha: Ye mahal kiska hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab ka. To mujhey uski ghairat yaad aai aur main peeth mor kar wapas aaya. To Umar roey aur unhon-ne kaha: Kya main tum par ghairat karunga Ya Rasulullah? (Bukhari: 3242)"
"1374","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pehla giroh jo Jannat mein daakhil hoga unki sooratein chaudahween raat key chaand ki soorat par hongi. Wo us mein na thookengey aur na naak saaf karengey aur na pakhaana karengey. Unkey bartan us mein sonay key hain. Unki kanghiyaan sonay aur chaandi ki hain. Unki angeethiyaan ood ki hain. Unka paseena musk hai. Aur un mein se har aik key liye do biwiyaan hongi jinki pindli ka gudaa gosht key peechey se husn ki wajah se dekha jaaeyga. Unkey darmiyaan ikhtelaaf na hoga aur na bugz. Unkey dil aik dil hain. Wo Allah ki subah aur shaam tasbeeh kartey hain. (Bukhari: 3245)"
"1375","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aur jo unkey peechey hain wo sakht roshan sitaarey jaisey hain. Unkey dil aik aadmi key dil par hain. Unkey darmiyaan ikhtelaaf na hoga aur na bugz. Un mein se har aadmi key liye do biwiyaan hain. Un mein se har aik ki pindli ka gudaa uskey gosht key peechey se husn ki wajah se dekha jaaeyga. Wo Allah ki subah aur shaam tasbeeh kartey hain. Wo beemaar na hongey aur na naak saaf karengey. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki. (Bukhari: 3246)"
"1376","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se sattar hazaar ya saat laakh zaroor daakhil hongey. Unka awwal daakhil na hoga yahan tak ke unka aakhir daakhil ho jaey. Unkey chehrey chaudahween raat key chaand ki soorat par hain. (Bukhari: 3247)"
"1377","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sundus ka jubba tohfey mein diya gaya. Jabke Aap resham se mana kartey they. To logon ne us par taajjub kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Beshak Jannat mein Saad bin Muaz key roomal is se behtar hain. (Bukhari: 3248)"
"1378","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein darkht hai jiskey saayey mein sawaar sau saal chaleyga aur use kaat na sakega. (Bukhari: 3251)"
"1379","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai us jaisa. Aur farmaya: Aur padho agar chaaaho: (Aur phailay huey saayey mein). (Bukhari: 3253)"
"1380","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat waley un se upar baala khaanon walon ko dekhtey hain jaisey wo guzartey huey chamakdaar sitaarey ko dekhtey hain jo ufaq mein mashriq ya maghrib se ghaaeb hota hai, unkey darmiyaan fazeelat ki wajah se. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo Nabiyon key maskan hain jinhey unkey siwa koi na pahunchega? Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi, qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Aadmi jo Allah par imaan laaey aur Rasoolon ki tasdeeq ki. (Bukhari: 3256)"
"1381","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bukhaar Jahannum ki bhaap mein se hai. To use paani se thanda karo. (Bukhari: 3263)"
"1382","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhaari aag Jahannum ki aag key sattar hisson mein se hissa hai. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya wo kaafi na thi? Aap ne farmaya: Wo un par unhath hisson se fazeelat di gai hai. Wo sab uski garmi jaisey hain. (Bukhari: 3265)"
"1383","[AI-translation] Usaama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qiyaamat key din aadmi laaya jaaeyga aur aag mein daala jaaeyga. To uski aantein aag mein nikal aaengi aur wo ghoomega jaisey gadha apni chakki key gird ghoomta hai. To aag waley us par jama hongey aur kahengey: Ae fulaan! Tumhara kya haal hai? Kya tum hamein neki ka hukm na detey they aur hamein buraai se na roktey they? Wo kahega: Main tumhey neki ka hukm deta tha aur use na karta tha. Aur tumhey buraai se rokta tha aur use karta tha. (Bukhari: 3267)"
"1384","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadu kya gaya yahan tak ke Aap ko khayaal hota tha ke Aap cheez kartey hain jabke Aap use nahi kartey. Yahan tak ke aik din Aap ne dua ki aur dua ki, phir farmaya: Kya tumhey maloom hai ke Allah ne mujhey us mein fatwa diya hai jis mein meri shifa hai? Merey paas do aadmi aey. To un mein se aik merey sar key paas baitha aur doosra merey pairon key paas. To un mein se aik ne doosrey se kaha: Aadmi ka dard kya hai? Us ne kaha: Jaadu kya gaya hai. Us ne kaha: Aur kis ne us par jaadu kya hai? Us ne kaha: Labeed bin Aasam ne. Us ne kaha: Kis mein? Us ne kaha: Kanghi aur baalon aur nar khajoor key gilaaf mein. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo kahaan hai? Us ne kaha: Zarwaan key kuwein mein. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski taraf nikley. Phir wapas aey aur Aap ne Aisha se farmaya jab wapas aey: Uski khajoorein goya shaitaanon key sar hain. To main ne kaha: Tum ne use nikaala? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Lekin main, Allah ne mujhey shifa dey di hai. Aur mujhey khauf hua ke wo logon par buraai ubhaareyga. Phir kuwaan dafan kar diya gaya. (Bukhari: 3268)"
"1385","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaitaan tum mein se kisi key paas aata hai aur kehta hai: Kis ne aisa paida kya? Kis ne aisa paida kya? Yahan tak ke kehta hai: Tumharey Rab ko kis ne paida kya? Phir jab us tak pahunchay to use Allah ki panaah maangni chaahiye aur rukna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 3276)"
"1386","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mashriq ki taraf ishaara kartey huey dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak fitna yahaan hai! Beshak fitna yahaan hai, jahaan se shaitaan ka seeng nikalta hai. (Bukhari: 3279)"
"1387","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab raat chhaa jaey ya farmaya: Raat ka hissa, to apne bachchon ko roko. Beshak shaitaan us waqt phailtey hain. Phir jab Isha ki ghadi guzar jaey to unhey chhoro. Aur apna darwaaza band karo aur Allah ka naam lo. Aur apna chiraagh bujha do aur Allah ka naam lo. Aur apni mashk baandho aur Allah ka naam lo. Aur apna bartan dhaanpo aur Allah ka naam lo, agarchey us par kuchh rakho. (Bukhari: 3280)"
"1388","[AI-translation] Sulaimaan bin Surad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baitha tha jabke do aadmi gaali galoch kar rahey they. To un mein se aik ka chehra surkh ho gaya aur uski ragein phool gaein. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main kalimat jaanta hun ke agar wo use kahey to us se jo wo paata hai door ho jaey. Kaash wo kahey: Main shaitaan se Allah ki panaah maangta hun, to us se jo wo paata hai door ho jaey. To unhon-ne us se kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaitaan se Allah ki panaah maango. To us ne kaha: Kya mujh mein junoon hai. (Bukhari: 3282). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadam key har betey ko shaitaan uski paidaish key waqt uskey pehlu mein apni ungli se chubhota hai, Isa bin Maryam key siwa. Wo chubhoney gaya aur parda chubhoya. (3286). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1389","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jamahi shaitaan se hai. Phir jab tum mein se koi jamaahi ley to use jitna ho sakey rokay. Beshak tum mein se koi jab Haa kehta hai to shaitaan hansta hai. (Bukhari: 3289)"
"1390","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achha khwaab Allah se hai. Aur bura khwaab shaitaan se hai. Phir jab tum mein se koi bura khwaab dekhey jis se wo darta hai to use apne baaen taraf thookna chaahiye aur uski buraai se Allah ki panaah maangni chaahiye. Beshak wo use nuqsaan na dega. (Bukhari: 3292)"
"1391","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jaagay aur wuzu karey to use teen martaba naak saaf karni chaahiye. Beshak shaitaan uski naak key baansay par raat guzaarta hai. (Bukhari: 3295)"
"1392","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par khutba detey huey suna jo farma rahey they: Saanpon ko qatl karo. Aur do lakeeron waley aur dum-katey ko qatl karo. Beshak wo dono beenaai mita detey hain aur hamal gira detey hain. Abdullah ne kaha: Phir jabke main saanp ko qatl karney key liye uskey peechey tha to mujhey Abu Lubaaba ne pukaara: Use qatl na karo. To main ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saanpon ko qatl karney ka hukm diya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Uskey baad Aap ne gharon walon se mana kya hai. Aur wo aabaad karney waliyaan hain. (Bukhari: 3297, 3298)"
"1393","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kufr ka sar mashriq ki taraf hai. Aur fakhr aur takabbur ghodon aur oonton walon aur zor se cheekhney waley oon walon mein hai. Aur sukoon bakriyon walon mein hai. (Bukhari: 3301)"
"1394","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amr Abu Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yaman ki taraf apne haath se ishaara kya aur farmaya: Imaan Yaman hai yahaan. Khabardaar! Beshak sakhti aur dilon ki ghalazat zor se cheekhney walon mein hai, oonton ki dumon ki jadon key paas, jahaan shaitaan key do seeng nikaltey hain, Rabeea aur Muzar mein. (Bukhari: 3302)"
"1395","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum murghon ki baang suno to Allah se uska fazl maango. Beshak us ne farishta dekha hai. Aur jab tum gadhon ki aawaaz suno to shaitaan se Allah ki panaah maango. Beshak us ne shaitaan dekha hai. (Bukhari: 3303)"
"1396","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israel mein se ummat gum hui hai, nahi maloom us ne kya kya. Aur beshak main use chuhey key siwa nahi samajhta. Jab uskey liye oontniyon ka doodh rakkha jaata hai to nahi peeta. Aur jab uskey liye bakriyon ka doodh rakkha jaata hai to peeta hai. To main ne Kaab ko bayan kya. To us ne kaha: Kya tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko use kehtey huey suna hai? Main ne kaha: Haan. Us ne mujh se baar baar kaha. To main ne kaha: Kya main Tauraat padhun? (Bukhari: 3305)"
"1397","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab makkhi tum mein se kisi key sharb at mein girey to use dubo dey, phir use nikaal dey. Beshak uskey aik par mein beemaari hai aur doosrey mein shifa hai. (Bukhari: 3320)"
"1398","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Faahisha aurat ko maaf kar diya gaya jo kuwein key sar par kuttey key paas se guzri jo haanp raha tha, qareeb tha ke pyaas use maar dey. To us ne apna moza utaara aur use apne dupattey se baandha aur uskey liye paani nikaala. To usey uskey sath maaf kar diya gaya. (Bukhari: 3321). Nabiyon ki hadeeson ki kitaab."
